## Usage

### Range and Precision
`min` / `max` set the range, `step` the increment, and `precision` the decimal places.
::::TuffDemoWrapper{demo="NumberInputNumberInputDemo" code-lang="vue"}
---
code: |
  <script setup lang="ts">
  import { ref } from 'vue'

  const percentage = ref(35)
  </script>

  <template>
    <TxNumberInput v-model="percentage" :min="0" :max="100" :step="5" :precision="0" />
  </template>
